<h1>Feedback and bug reports</h1>
<p class="lede">A way to send us feedback and report bugs is coming soon.</p>
<p>We want to hear what's working, what isn't and what you'd like Deaftly to do. We're setting up a proper way to receive your messages, and this page will have a form as soon as it's ready.</p>
<p>In the meantime, <a href="/help/">the help pages</a> cover using Deaftly, installing and updating, and what to do when something isn't working.</p>
